{
 "comment": "Tauren Druid clone -- Wrath cast-time opener. Mulgore 1->10 for a Tauren Shaman -- the second authored zone, built with every lesson the Durotar 1->12 run taught: all objective slots mined (quest_template RequiredNpcOrGo1-4 + item slots), real spawn rows (never bucket centroids), quests at green parity / grinds a level band below, safe unstick hubs (APCampNarache/MGBloodhoof/MGRaintotem, game_tele 100004/100015/100016), repair NPCs authored separately from junk vendors (Bronk Steelrage / Harant Ironbrace), anchor rotation. Zone constraint discovered in mining: Mulgore's marquee chains are locked behind GAMEOBJECT quests (753's water pitcher blocks 755/757/781; 751's caravan chest blocks 764/765), so the supported set is 752, 747->750->780, 748, 745, 761, 766 (four-family 100%-drop collection), 743, 833. Opportunistic spell 403 (Lightning Bolt) exercises the cast-time ranged-opener archetype end to end.",
